or\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F15.20.7a5cc9\">15.20.7a5cc9</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 24, 2025<br/>Winter Update 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20251108013743&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Imperial_371f7a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an imperial.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>While red deer is known as a stag or hart, an imperial has a specific type of antler, known as a 14-pointer. On the Isle of Ada, home of Eldoran the Ambitious and his knights, there have been sightings of a specifically rare breed with silver gray fur. While it is allowed to hunt deer on the isle, the knights of the Stag have strict rules concerning the population of their game. Knights only hunt as many deer as needed or to keep their number in check in regards to nature and the other wildlife roaming their homeland. The silver imperial is said to have the most tender venison and majestic fur which some of the knights of the Stag use to garnish their armour. Not out of vanity, but out of respect.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Death\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Death <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Cursed Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_Big_de8a1f.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:ab